#### Phase 5: Quality Assurance with CodeRabbit AI

CodeRabbit provides comprehensive AI-powered code review:

\`\`\`typescript
// CodeRabbit configuration
interface CodeRabbitConfig {
  reviewDepth: 'surface' | 'deep' | 'comprehensive';
  focusAreas: ('security' | 'performance' | 'maintainability' | 'testing')[];
  autofix: boolean;
  teamStandards: CodingStandards;
}

// Automated code review workflow
async function codeReviewPipeline(
  pullRequest: PullRequest,
  config: CodeRabbitConfig
) {
  const review = await codeRabbit.reviewPR({
    pr: pullRequest,
    config,
    previousReviews: await getPreviousReviews(pullRequest.base)
  });

  return {
    issues: review.identifyIssues(),
    suggestions: review.generateSuggestions(),
    autoFixes: config.autofix ? review.generateFixes() : [],
    qualityScore: review.calculateQualityScore()
  };
}
\`\`\`

**CodeRabbit Review Categories:**
- **Security Analysis**: Vulnerability detection, authentication flaws, data exposure risks
- **Performance Optimization**: Bundle size analysis, render optimization, database query efficiency
- **Code Quality**: Maintainability scores, technical debt identification, pattern consistency
- **Testing Coverage**: Test completeness, edge case identification, integration test suggestions

#### Phase 6: Production Deployment with Supabase

Supabase provides the backend infrastructure for rapid MVP deployment:

\`\`\`typescript
// Supabase integration architecture
interface SupabaseSetup {
  database: DatabaseSchema;
  auth: AuthConfig;
  storage: StorageConfig;
  realtime: RealtimeConfig;
  edgeFunctions: EdgeFunctionConfig[];
}

// Automated Supabase deployment
async function deployToSupabase(
  project: GeneratedProject,
  config: SupabaseSetup
) {
  // Database setup
  await supabase.database.createSchema(config.database);
  await supabase.database.seedData(project.sampleData);

  // Authentication configuration
  await supabase.auth.configure(config.auth);

  // Edge functions deployment
  for (const edgeFunction of config.edgeFunctions) {
    await supabase.functions.deploy(edgeFunction);
  }

  // Real-time subscriptions
  await supabase.realtime.configure(config.realtime);

  return {
    databaseUrl: supabase.database.url,
    authConfig: supabase.auth.config,
    apiEndpoints: supabase.functions.endpoints
  };
}
\`\`\`

## Domain-Driven Design with AI Agents

### Intelligent Architecture Planning

Modern domain-driven design leverages AI agents to analyze complex business requirements and generate architectural recommendations:

\`\`\`typescript
// AI-powered domain modeling
interface DomainModel {
  aggregates: Aggregate[];
  boundedContexts: BoundedContext[];
  domainEvents: DomainEvent[];
  services: DomainService[];
}

// AI agent for domain analysis
class DomainAnalysisAgent {
  async analyzeDomain(requirements: BusinessRequirements): Promise<DomainModel> {
    const analysis = await this.ai.analyze({
      requirements,
      patterns: ['DDD', 'event-sourcing', 'CQRS'],
      constraints: ['scalability', 'maintainability', 'testability']
    });

    return {
      aggregates: analysis.identifyAggregates(),
      boundedContexts: analysis.defineBoundedContexts(),
      domainEvents: analysis.extractDomainEvents(),
      services: analysis.recommendServices()
    };
  }

  async generateArchitecture(model: DomainModel): Promise<ArchitectureSpecs> {
    return await this.ai.generateSpecs({
      model,
      targetPlatforms: ['web', 'mobile', 'api'],
      scalingRequirements: this.requirements.scaling,
      integrationNeeds: this.requirements.integrations
    });
  }
}
\`\`\`

**Domain-Driven AI Patterns:**
- **Aggregate Analysis**: AI identifies natural business boundaries and aggregate roots
- **Event Storm Facilitation**: Automated discovery of domain events and workflows
- **Bounded Context Mapping**: Intelligent context boundary recommendations
- **Anti-Corruption Layer Generation**: Automated integration pattern suggestions

### Microservices Architecture with AI Guidance

\`\`\`typescript
// AI-guided microservices decomposition
interface MicroserviceBlueprint {
  services: ServiceDefinition[];
  dataFlows: DataFlowDiagram;
  communicationPatterns: CommunicationPattern[];
  deploymentStrategy: DeploymentConfig;
}

async function generateMicroservicesArchitecture(
  domain: DomainModel
): Promise<MicroserviceBlueprint> {
  const architect = new AIArchitectAgent();

  return await architect.decompose({
    domain,
    principles: [
      'single-responsibility',
      'loose-coupling',
      'high-cohesion',
      'autonomous-teams'
    ],
    constraints: {
      maxServiceSize: '500-lines',
      communicationLatency: '<100ms',
      dataConsistency: 'eventual'
    }
  });
}
\`\`\`

