**Purpose**: Apply domain-driven design principles to create more maintainable, scalable, and understandable codebases, especially effective when working with AI development tools.

**Core DDD Concepts**:
- **Ubiquitous Language**: Establish shared vocabulary between developers, stakeholders, and AI tools
- **Bounded Contexts**: Define clear boundaries between different parts of your application
- **Aggregates**: Design data models that maintain consistency and business rules
- **Domain Services**: Implement business logic in dedicated, testable services

**AI Development Integration**:
